<title>USA: Dart Group, Crown Books, Trak Auto halted.</title>
<headline>Dart Group, Crown Books, Trak Auto halted.</headline>
<dateline>LANDOVER, MD. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Dart Group and its two wholly owned companies -- Crown Books and Trak Auto Corp -- were halted Monday, pending news.</p>
<p>Officials from Dart were not immediately available to comment on the news.</p>
<p>An official from Crown Books would not comment either. He said all three companies may announce their earnings today.</p>
<p>He did not give further details.</p>
</text>
